    "title": "12/3 Prep Basketball Recap - Homestead tops Manchester - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Glenn Marini ,\n1 hours ago\nFORT WAYNE, Ind. (WANE) – Homestead, ranked no. 20 in the most recent IBCA Boys State Poll, topped defending 2A state champion Manchester 82-23 on Wednesday night at Spartan Arena to headline area prep basketball action.\nMack Welker led the way for Homestead with 25 points while Ryder Imel chipped in with 23.\nHomestead now heads to Warsaw to face the Tigers on Friday. You can see coverage of that game Friday night at 11 pm on the Highlight Zone, Fort Wayne’s no. 1 sports show!\nCopyright 2025 Nexstar Media, Inc. All rights reserved. This material may not be published, broadcast, rewritten, or redistributed. For the latest news, weather, sports, and streaming video, head to WANE 15.",
